  "Ponavljanje i mala odstupanja predstavljaju susedstvo kao mrežu ličnih putanja.": "Repetition and small variations present the neighbourhood as a network of personal routes.",
  "Uporedite gustinu tragova sa prazninama koje usmeravaju pogled.": "Compare the density of marks with the gaps that guide the eye.",
  "Grafika i crtež. Ponavljanje i mala odstupanja predstavljaju susedstvo kao mrežu ličnih putanja. Uporedite gustinu tragova sa prazninama koje usmeravaju pogled.": "Printmaking and drawing. Repetition and small variations present the neighbourhood as a network of personal routes. Compare the density of marks with the gaps that guide the eye.",
  "Porodična radionica · Otisak susedstva": "Family workshop · Imprint of a Neighbourhood",
  "Vođeno čitanje · Otisak susedstva": "Guided interpretation · Imprint of a Neighbourhood",
  "Razgovor sa kustosom · Otisak susedstva": "Conversation with the curator · Imprint of a Neighbourhood",
  "Radionica posmatranja · Otisak susedstva": "Observation workshop · Imprint of a Neighbourhood",
  "Na izložbi „Otisak susedstva“, delo „Ritam balkona“ uvodi temu „grafika i crtež“. Ponavljanje i mala odstupanja predstavljaju susedstvo kao mrežu ličnih putanja. Pravougaona polja balkona raspoređena su u nepravilan niz. Uporedite gustinu tragova sa prazninama koje usmeravaju pogled.": "In “Imprint of a Neighbourhood”, “Rhythm of Balconies” introduces the theme of printmaking and drawing. Repetition and small variations present the neighbourhood as a network of personal routes. Rectangular balcony fields form an irregular sequence. Compare the density of marks with the gaps that guide the eye.",
  "Otisak susedstva · celina 1 · mesto 1": "Imprint of a Neighbourhood · section 1 · position 1",
  "Na izložbi „Otisak susedstva“, delo „Knjiga kratkih šetnji“ uvodi temu „grafika i crtež“. Ponavljanje i mala odstupanja predstavljaju susedstvo kao mrežu ličnih putanja. Svaki list beleži jednu kratku putanju kroz naselje. Uporedite gustinu tragova sa prazninama koje usmeravaju pogled.": "In “Imprint of a Neighbourhood”, “Book of Short Walks” introduces the theme of printmaking and drawing. Repetition and small variations present the neighbourhood as a network of personal routes. Each page records a short route through a neighbourhood. Compare the density of marks with the gaps that guide the eye.",
  "Otisak susedstva · celina 1 · mesto 2": "Imprint of a Neighbourhood · section 1 · position 2",
  "Na izložbi „Otisak susedstva“, delo „Kišni raster“ uvodi temu „grafika i crtež“. Ponavljanje i mala odstupanja predstavljaju susedstvo kao mrežu ličnih putanja. Sitne tačke postepeno prelaze iz svetlog u tamno polje. Uporedite gustinu tragova sa prazninama koje usmeravaju pogled.": "In “Imprint of a Neighbourhood”, “Rain Grid” introduces the theme of printmaking and drawing. Repetition and small variations present the neighbourhood as a network of personal routes. Small dots gradually move from light to dark. Compare the density of marks with the gaps that guide the eye.",
  "Otisak susedstva · celina 2 · mesto 3": "Imprint of a Neighbourhood · section 2 · position 3",
  "Na izložbi „Otisak susedstva“, delo „Trag točka“ uvodi temu „grafika i crtež“. Ponavljanje i mala odstupanja predstavljaju susedstvo kao mrežu ličnih putanja. Kružni trag prekida ravnomeran nanos štamparske boje. Uporedite gustinu tragova sa prazninama koje usmeravaju pogled.": "In “Imprint of a Neighbourhood”, “Wheel Trace” introduces the theme of printmaking and drawing. Repetition and small variations present the neighbourhood as a network of personal routes. A circular mark interrupts an even layer of printing ink. Compare the density of marks with the gaps that guide the eye.",
  "Otisak susedstva · celina 2 · mesto 4": "Imprint of a Neighbourhood · section 2 · position 4",
  "Na izložbi „Otisak susedstva“, delo „Mapa susedstva“ uvodi temu „grafika i crtež“. Ponavljanje i mala odstupanja predstavljaju susedstvo kao mrežu ličnih putanja. Ulice su prikazane kao nizovi belih prolaza između crnih blokova. Uporedite gustinu tragova sa prazninama koje usmeravaju pogled.": "In “Imprint of a Neighbourhood”, “Neighbourhood Map” introduces the theme of printmaking and drawing. Repetition and small variations present the neighbourhood as a network of personal routes. Streets appear as white passages between black blocks. Compare the density of marks with the gaps that guide the eye.",
  "Otisak susedstva · celina 3 · mesto 5": "Imprint of a Neighbourhood · section 3 · position 5",
  "Na izložbi „Otisak susedstva“, delo „Sedam prolaza“ uvodi temu „grafika i crtež“. Ponavljanje i mala odstupanja predstavljaju susedstvo kao mrežu ličnih putanja. Sedam otvora ponavlja isti osnovni oblik uz sitne razlike u pritisku linije. Uporedite gustinu tragova sa prazninama koje usmeravaju pogled.": "In “Imprint of a Neighbourhood”, “Seven Passages” introduces the theme of printmaking and drawing. Repetition and small variations present the neighbourhood as a network of personal routes. Seven openings repeat a basic shape with subtle changes in line pressure. Compare the density of marks with the gaps that guide the eye.",
  "Otisak susedstva · celina 3 · mesto 6": "Imprint of a Neighbourhood · section 3 · position 6",
  "Na izložbi „Otisak susedstva“, delo „Slova sa fasade“ uvodi temu „grafika i crtež“. Ponavljanje i mala odstupanja predstavljaju susedstvo kao mrežu ličnih putanja. Fragmenti izmišljenih radnji složeni su u novu tipografsku celinu. Uporedite gustinu tragova sa prazninama koje usmeravaju pogled.": "In “Imprint of a Neighbourhood”, “Letters from a Facade” introduces the theme of printmaking and drawing. Repetition and small variations present the neighbourhood as a network of personal routes. Fragments of imagined shop signs form a new typographic composition. Compare the density of marks with the gaps that guide the eye.",
  "Otisak susedstva · celina 4 · mesto 7": "Imprint of a Neighbourhood · section 4 · position 7",
  "Na izložbi „Otisak susedstva“, delo „Čajnik za dvoje“ uvodi temu „grafika i crtež“. Ponavljanje i mala odstupanja predstavljaju susedstvo kao mrežu ličnih putanja. Kratak izliv i široka drška prilagođeni su sporom sipanju. Uporedite gustinu tragova sa prazninama koje usmeravaju pogled.": "In “Imprint of a Neighbourhood”, “Teapot for Two” introduces the theme of printmaking and drawing. Repetition and small variations present the neighbourhood as a network of personal routes. A short spout and broad handle support slow pouring. Compare the density of marks with the gaps that guide the eye.",
  "Otisak susedstva · celina 4 · mesto 8": "Imprint of a Neighbourhood · section 4 · position 8",
